        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Parallel Mount Drop Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse when Parallel Mounting (Mounting on the push side of an outswing door). For use with <a href=\"/products/lcn-4040-super-smoothee-grade-1-door-closer\"><b>LCN 4041</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/lcn-4040-series-replacement-ada-compliant-heavy-duty-door-closer-global-tc4300\"><b>Global TC4300</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/extra-heavy-duty-door-closer-deltana-dc40\"><b>Deltana DC40</b></a> door closers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4041-series-door-closer-drop-plate-dp4041s\"><b>Regular Mount Drop Plate</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse on outswing doors with narrow top door frames and doors with glass, when the glass interferes with closer mounting. Often used on metal framed glass store front doors. Also used to lower a door closer up to 1-1/2\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
